<small>A Song of degrees.</small><br /><sup><b>1</b></sup> Behold, bless ye the LORD, all <i>ye</i> servants of the LORD, which by night stand in the house of the LORD.<br />
<sup><b>2</b></sup> Lift up your hands <i>in</i> the sanctuary, and bless the LORD.<br />
<sup><b>3</b></sup> The LORD that made heaven and earth bless thee out of Zion. <br />
